<title>PORTUGAL: FinMin says Portugal entry to euro attainable.</title>
<headline>FinMin says Portugal entry to euro attainable.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's entry to the European single currency in 1999 is clearly attainable, Finance Minister Antonio Sousa Franco told a news conference.  </p>
<p>&quot;The markets are already discounting our clearly attainable objective: the entry of Portugal to the euro on January 1 1999,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>The news conference was called to give details of the government's 1997 budget proposals presented to parliament.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
